From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew Lam <matthew.lam@openrouter.ai>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:21:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Point the verification skills at paths Claude Code and
 Codex read

Upstream writes the generated skill to .cursor/skills/, which neither
Claude Code nor Codex reads, so the verify skill never registers. Write
it to .agents/skills/ (Codex) with a .claude/skills/ symlink (Claude
Code), check the symlink resolves, and have maintain treat the pair as
one skill instead of asking which of two candidates to audit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
